0.813 Yaw DIR32/STEP33; pitch DIR26/STEP12; carriage DIR21/STEP22; BNO085 Bus B SDA4/SCL5 address 0x4A
0.828 Physical PITCH feedback = BNO ROLL; pitch targets and telemetry use roll degrees.
0.828 Carriage zero is startup step count only; units are STEPS, not mm. Software envelope +/-500 steps; no homing.
0.844 North requires calibrated baseline and BNO accuracy >=2; low accuracy stops yaw operations. Independent 150 ms stale stop for all motion.
0.860 Stable fresh pitch can enter PITCH-ONLY READY after north-baseline timeout, regardless of accuracy. No automatic fallback motion.
